# QA Bug Report Sample

This repository contains a comprehensive QA Bug Report Sheet created during manual testing of web and mobile applications. The document demonstrates my ability to identify, document, and communicate software defects using industry-standard bug reporting practices.

The sheet includes real-world bug reports covering Functional, UI, UX, Compatibility, and Performance issues across multiple applications. Each defect is documented with detailed test case information, actual vs. expected results, severity, priority, environment details, supporting evidence (screenshots/videos), and team assignments.

Additionally, the template supports complete defect lifecycle tracking, including developer updates, QA retesting, repeated issue verification, and final status management. This showcases my practical experience in software quality assurance, defect management, and collaboration with frontend and backend development teams.

### Key Highlights

* Structured and professional bug reporting
* Functional, UI, UX, Compatibility & Performance testing
* Severity and Priority classification
* Evidence-based reporting (screenshots/videos)
* Defect lifecycle and retesting workflow
* Web, Mobile App, Frontend & Backend issue tracking
* Industry-standard QA documentation practices

Tools & Skills: Manual Testing, Bug Reporting, Test Case Design, Defect Tracking, Quality Assurance, Web Testing, Mobile App Testing.
